    },
    {
      "title": "Netanyahu Pushed for Attack on Iran Ahead of Israeli Election, Officials Say",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/26/world/middleeast/netanyahu-iran-israel-election.html",
      "description": "Israel’s military chief resisted the prime minister, who then pressed in recent days for a separate action, short of an overt strike, according to an official and a person briefed on the matter.",
